1
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:24,800
Ancestor, I have a massive
secret to expose.

2
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,360
Imperial Physician Xiao has defiled
the inner court.

3
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,360
His crimes are unforgivable.

4
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,600
He had an affair with the Empress Dowager
in the Palace of Earthly Tranquility

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,130
and tried to hide the secret
of the royal heir.

6
00:00:32,439 --> 00:00:35,570
This silver needle has the little
Emperor's blood on it.

7
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,160
What a biting dog.

8
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,840
Since you are willing to risk your life,

9
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,680
you will work for me from now on.

10
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:47,160
At the ceremony tonight,
you will be the killing knife

11
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:50,840
and bite the Empress Dowager
and Xiao Han to death for me.

12
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,440
I will not fail my mission.

13
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,160
What exactly did that woman
say to you in there?

14
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,960
Nothing.

15
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:00,040
You two were alone for two hours,

16
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,400
and you came out smelling like perfume.

17
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,640
You're telling me it's nothing?

18
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:06,170
You're being too secretive.
That's not cool.

19
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:14,480
Warning: Midnight has arrived.

20
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,840
Mandatory task:

21
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:18,400
The Ancestral Sacrifice and
Public Trial Ceremony has begun.

22
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,280
What is this? A death notice?

23
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,840
The good show is about to begin.

24
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:27,920
Halt.

25
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:31,440
Isn't this our arrogant
Imperial Physician Xiao?

26
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:33,160
Why are you still putting on airs

27
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:35,000
when you're about to die?

28
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,520
You rootless castrated dog.

29
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,320
Get lost,

30
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,759
or I'll bleed you first.

31
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,840
What are you so arrogant about?

32
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,320
You're just a fifth-rank guard.

33
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,000
I'm now the Chief Eunuch's favorite.

34
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,600
Xiao Han, tonight's ceremony
will be your death.

35
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,920
I want to see you chopped into meat paste
by the Iron Guards with my own eyes.

36
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,640
Just kick the dog out of the way.

37
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,970
Don't dirty your knife.

38
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,040
Empress Dowager.

39
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,720
The midnight ancestral sacrifice
ceremony is imminent.

40
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,120
According to the ancestral rules,

41
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:07,240
the new Emperor must offer incense and
report to the late Emperor's tomb,

42
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,440
acknowledge his ancestors,

43
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,320
and officially enter

44
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,639
the royal genealogy.

45
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,920
The time is approaching.

46
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:14,120
Please move to prepare, Your Grace.

47
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,800
Chief,

48
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,920
I want to expose Imperial Physician Xiao's
affair with the Empress Dowager.

49
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:21,520
That little Emperor is simply the bastard
of this dog physician.

50
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,200
Eunuch Chen, falsely accusing a court
official without evidence

51
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:26,560
will result in your tongue
being pulled out.

52
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,760
Still stubborn?

53
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:28,960
Chief Eunuch,

54
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,640
I have solid proof.

55
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,640
This silver needle

56
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,840
has the blood he left behind when he
treated that little bastard tonight.

57
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,920
left behind

58
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,840
And I saw with my own eyes outside the
window of the Palace of Earthly Tranquility

59
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,800
that Imperial Physician Xiao and the
Empress Dowager were half-undressed

60
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,200
and hugging tightly.

61
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,720
This is defiling the inner court.

62
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:45,840
His crimes are unforgivable.

63
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,920
Insolent! How can you take
the Emperor's bloodline

64
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,320
so lightly?

65
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,840
Empress Dowager,

66
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:52,560
I am terrified.

67
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,400
But this concerns the royal bloodline,

68
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,320
and no confusion can be tolerated.

69
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,120
Since someone has reported it publicly,

70
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,040
to silence the crowd,

71
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:03,400
we can only ask the little Emperor to take
a blood test to verify his paternity.

72
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,260
You can test it,

73
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:07,760
but if it turns out that this dog slave
deliberately framed him,

74
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,760
can you and he bear the capital crime

75
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,440
of slandering the royal heir?

76
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,770
If there is any mistake,

77
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,400
I am willing to apologize with my death.

78
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,920
Men, keep an eye on
Imperial Physician Xiao

79
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,240
and bring some water.

80
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,560
I'd like to see who dares.

81
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,600
You don't need to make a move.

82
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,040
I'll play with them.

83
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:29,920
Alum was added

84
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,079
to forcibly dissolve red blood cells.

85
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:34,079
Anyone's blood will blend in it.

86
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,040
They came prepared,

87
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,770
but it's just a cheap trick.

88
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Physician Xiao,

89
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:39,960
please.

90
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:43,280
Whether you are innocent
or have defiled the inner palace,

91
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,240
it all depends on this drop of blood.

92
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,920
Make sure your hand doesn't shake.

93
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,920
Physician Xiao,

94
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,760
don't you usually boast about
your unparalleled medical skills

95
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:53,360
and act so high and mighty
in the Imperial Hospital?

96
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,890
Not daring to use the needle
means you have a guilty conscience.

97
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,600
Empress Dowager,
the evidence is irrefutable.

98
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,130
What else do you have to say?

99
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,720
Guards,

100
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,920
arrest this venomous woman
who defiled the inner palace,

101
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,000
along with this fake prince
and her paramour,

102
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,800
and execute them on the spot!

103
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,120
They are going to kill
the Empress Dowager.

104
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,880
Doesn't that mean we've completed
the system mission?

105
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,160
That mute lunatic

106
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,890
actually used herself as bait.

107
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:24,690
Whatever. Since I'm handsome
and kind-hearted,

108
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,400
I'll reluctantly protect you.

109
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,800
Chief,

110
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,480
there's no need to dirty your hands

111
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,800
with such a venomous woman.

112
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,560
I am willing to carry out justice

113
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,920
and behead her myself.

114
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:36,480
As long as I kill
the Empress Dowager myself,

115
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,880
the dungeon points will be mine.

116
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,720
Eunuch Chen is right.

117
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,400
My blade is always accurate.
